<NON_STANDARD>\nBalaa ngay dieul auto bi gua loué khol ko bou bakh ndakh dara sikou thi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2462,"row":{"en":"I was fortunate to attend a school that offered a wide range of AP courses and extracurricular activities, which gave me the opportunity to explore my interests and learn about different career paths.","wo":"Yàlla wërsagalee nama ma jaar ci ekol bu daan amal ay kuuri AP ak yeneen xeeti njàngale yu génn klaas yi, loolu nekkoon lu am solo ndax may nama ma jàng yeneen mbir ba noppi jàngaale yeneen yooni tekki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYalla weursaguele nama ma diar thi école bou dane amal ay kuuri AP ak yénéne xeeti ndiangale you guéne classe yi, lolou nékone lou am solo ndakh may nama ma diang yénéne mbir ba nopi diangale yénéne yooni tekki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2463,"row":{"en":"I love you too","wo":"man ci sama bopp","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane thi sama bopp\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2464,"row":{"en":"Person A: We could call it Back to Australia. It would be a tribute to our home country and a celebration of our unique scents.","wo":"Nit A: Mën nanu ko tuddee Dellu Australie. Dina nekk luy delloo njukkël réew mi nu cosaanoo, di màggalaale sunu xetu parfum bu amul fenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit A: Meun nagnou ko toudé Dellou Australie. Dina neuk louy dello njukkeul réw mi nou cosano, di magalaalé sounou khétou parfum bou amoul feun.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2465,"row":{"en":"constantly","wo":"biy am saa su ne","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbiy am saa sou né\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2466,"row":{"en":"Use a clean cloth to blot up the spill and then wipe the area with a damp mop.","wo":"Wutal morso bu wax te set nga màpp li tuuru, ba noppi nga wut morso bu xawa tooy nga fomp ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWoutal morso bou wakh té set nga map li tourou, ba noppi nga wout morso bou khawa toy nga fomp ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2467,"row":{"en":"Doctor: Can you tell me more about the pain? Where is it located?","wo":"Doktër: Ak leneen lan ngama mëna waxaat ci metit wi? Fan la féete?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur: Ak leneen lane ngama meuna wakhat si metite wi? Fane la fété?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2468,"row":{"en":"If the item is returned by post, the customer must return the item within 14 days of purchase and the item must be in the same condition as it was when it was purchased.","wo":"Sudee ci post la kiliyaan bi di delloo li mu jëndoon, fàww mu yónnee ko ci diir bu weesuwul 14 fan ginaaw bimu ko jëndee, te warul am benn sikk bu ci nekkuk woon bimu koy jënd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoudé thi post la client bi di dello li mou dieundone faw mou yoné ko si diir bou wésouwoul 14 fane guinaw bimou ko dieundé té waroul ame béne sikk bou si neukoukeu wone bimou koy dieundé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2469,"row":{"en":"That is equivalent to the wind forces of a category 4 hurricane!","wo":"Dooleem mingi méngoo ak dooley sikloonu 4 eelu dara!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDolém moungui mengoo ak doléy siklonou 4 éllou dara!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2470,"row":{"en":"The entry period ends tonight at midnight (Eastern time zone!).","wo":"Diiru dugg bi mingi jeex tay su minuit jotee (ET!).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiourou dougg bi moungui diekh tay sou minuit dioté (ET!)\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2471,"row":{"en":"Joseph: That's terrible, Jasmine.","wo":"Joseph: Loolu du yoon, Jasmine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJoseph: Loolou dou yone Jasmine\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2472,"row":{"en":"The refrigerant then passes through the condenser coils, where it releases the heat to the outside air * Thermostat: This controls the temperature inside the refrigerator and freezer.","wo":"Refrigerant bi dafay jaar ci biir serpentin kondensatër yi, foofu lañuy bàyyi tàngoor wi mu génn ci air bi ci biti * Thermostat: Mooy saytu tàngoor wala seddaay bi ci biir frigo bi wala congelatër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRefrigerant bi dafay diar thi biir serpentin condensateur yi, foofu laniouy bayi tangor wi mou guenn thi air bi thi biti * Thermostat: Mooy saytou tangor wala sedday bi thi biir frigo bi wala congelateur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2473,"row":{"en":"* A widening gap between the rich and the poor. Egypt has a high Gini coefficient, which measures inequality.","wo":"* Ñi am di gëna am, ñi ñàkk di gëna ñàkk. Egypt dafa yéeg lool ci xaymag Gini, mooy xayma ñàkka yamale gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGni ame di geuna ame, gni gnakk di geuna gnakk. Egypte dafa yégue lole thi khaymag gini, moy khayma gnaka yamalé gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2474,"row":{"en":"More than one math card game has been destroyed by a careless or reckless toddler before the game was finished.","wo":"Lu ëppu benn fowokaayu kart math ab gone gu bayyiwul xel wala gu yëngu yàq nako laataa pomi di jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou eup ben fowokaye kart math ab goné gu bayioul khél wala gu yeungue yak nako lata pomi di diekh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2475,"row":{"en":"Organ Trafficking: A Growing Problem Organ trafficking is a serious problem that affects people around the world.","wo":"Jaay cëri nit: Njaayum cëri nit mi ngi gëna bari ci àdduna bi, di yóbbe doomi aadama yi jafe-jafe yu rëy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiay thieurou nitt: Ndiayoum thieurou nitt mi ngui geuna bari thi aduna bi, di yobé domi adama yi diafé diafé you reuy.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2476,"row":{"en":"According to this myth, the gods were angered by the behavior of humans, so they sent down a