DARD>\nMalaad bi mangui thi diam bou bakh machallah\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2482,"row":{"en":"I'm sorry","wo":"Man itam bëgg naa la","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane itame beug nala\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2483,"row":{"en":"The police chief's daughter, who is also the lead actress in the local theater company, is about to go on stage for her big performance.","wo":"Doom ju jigéen ju njiitu poliis bi, aktris bu mag bu jiite kuréelu teyaatar bu dëkk bi, mooy waaja yéeg ci kaw seen bi def mbir yu rëy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoom dji djiguéne dji njiitou police bi, actrice bou mague bou djité koureulou theatre bou deuk bi, moy wadia yégue thi kaw séne bi def mbir you reuy.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2484,"row":{"en":"When you eat, your body breaks down the carbohydrates in your food into glucose, which is then absorbed into your bloodstream.","wo":"Soo lekkee sa yaram dafay jël glusid yi ci ñam yi mu soppi leen def glucose, glucose boobu mooy jàll ci deret ji.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo lekke sa yaram dafay dieul gluside yi si niam yi mou sopi lene def glucose, glucose bobou moy djal si deret dji.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2485,"row":{"en":"Of course, there are also those folks who, by virtue of their personality, may simply be more sensitive and timid.","wo":"Dëgg la dina am nit ñoo xam ni ñooy gëna bari kersa wala ñoom la seen yaram di gëna daw, lépp di aju ci ni nit ki bindoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeug la dina ame nitt gno khamni gnoy geuna bari kersa wala gnom la sen yaram di geuna daw, lep di adjou thi ni nitt ki bindo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2486,"row":{"en":"The next step was to schedule a driving test.","wo":"Li ci topp mooy ñu jàppal ma bis ma def examen dawal bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLici top moy gnou diaphal ma bisse ma def examen dawal bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2487,"row":{"en":"When translating these devices, I must find equivalents in the target language that will have the same impact on the reader.","wo":"Sooy tekki mbir yu melnii, fàww nga wut lu ñuy méngool ci làkk wi ngay tekki suko ki koy jàng mana am yëg-yëg bi ciy nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy tekki mbir you melnii faw nga wout lougnouy mengool si lak wi ngay tekki souko ki koy diang meuna ame yeug yeug bi si nekk\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2488,"row":{"en":"Once you have found your ancestors, you can view their records.","wo":"Soo xasee ba gis say maam mën nga gis seeni dokimaa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoo khassé ba guiss say mame meun nga guiss séni dokima\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2489,"row":{"en":"The beer was actually pretty good, and we all had a great time.","wo":"Bieer bi neexoon na lool, nu naan ba sunu xol sedd.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiere bi nekhone na loool, gnou nane ba souniou khol sedd.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2490,"row":{"en":"Anyway, besides email and a phone meeting regarding the Secret, that was yesterday.","wo":"Lumu mëna doon, ginaaw imeel ak ndaje ci telefon ci lu jël ci Sekkere bi, ndémb la woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoumou meuna done, guinaw email ak ndadjé ci telefon thi lou dieul ci seukere bi, ndem la wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2491,"row":{"en":"This is not easy, but it is possible through meditation and other spiritual practices.","wo":"Loolu yombul, waaye mën nañu ko amee ci meditasioŋ ak topp sunu ngëm.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou yomboul wayé meune nagnou ko amé ci méditation ak top sounou ngeum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2492,"row":{"en":"Bachelor Swap features two identical twin brothers switching places.","wo":"Bachelor Swap dafa wane ñaari seex yu nuróo di weccoo palaas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBachelor swap dafa wane gnaari sekh you nouroo di wethio palaas.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2493,"row":{"en":"Light is needed for us to see, but darkness is also important.","wo":"Dunuy soxla leer ngir mëna gis, waaye lëndëm itam amna solo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDougnou sokhla leer nguir meuna guiss wayé leundeum itame amna solo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2494,"row":{"en":"Once you know what you like, start shopping for clothes that fit your personality.","wo":"Soo demee ba xam li nga bëgg, nga daal di tàmbali sol lu méngoo ak linga doon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo démé ba kham li nga beug, nga daldi tambali sol lou mengoo ak linga done.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2495,"row":{"en":"Suffice it to say that my greatest dread is something so insidious and far-reaching that it defies description.","wo":"Jarul may wax ni lima gëna ragal, dama xóot lool te sori lool ba kenn mënu ci joxe tegtal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJaroul may wakh ni lima geuna ragal dama khoot lool té sori lool ba kene meuneu thi diokhé tegtal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2496,"row":{"en":"Common side effects of Flecainide include headaches, dizziness, upset stomach, and feeling tired or weak.","wo":"Njeexital yi toppu pajj ak Flecainide bokkunaci boppu buy metti, miir, biir buy woñaaru ak di yeg coono wala neew kattan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdiekhital yi topou padj ak Flecainide bokounathi bopp bouy metti, miir, biir bouy wognarou ak di yeug thiono wala néw katané.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2497,"row":{"en":"Connect the tension clamps on both sides of the ground wire with a 15.5m long wire rope sleeve and 3T bend joint.","wo":"Keppal pince tension yi ci ñaari wetu cable terre bi ak lamu fiil (manchon cable) bu am guddaayu 15,5m ak join coudé 3T.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeppal pince tension y